      "html": "<p>Search for <strong>Care Inspectorate compliance software</strong> and most results are English tools built around CQC. In Scotland the regulator is the Care Inspectorate, the framework is the Health and Social Care Standards and the Care Inspectorate's own quality framework, and the grades run on a six-point scale from unsatisfactory to excellent. Compliance software that assumes the English system quietly steers a Scottish service towards the wrong evidence.</p><p>This page sets out what a Care-Inspectorate-registered service actually keeps on top of, in the language the regulator uses, and where a tool like quickler helps and where it deliberately stops.</p>"
    },
